arged from service, medical/religious personnel)")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Common Access Card (only if designated as Active Military or Active Reserve or Active Selected Reserve)")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Military Discharge documentation, which includes date of birth and/or Social Security Number and/or Tribal ID")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Northern Mariana Card")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Permanent Resident Card")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Permanent Resident Alien Card")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Permanent Resident Re-Entry Permit")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Temporary Resident Identification Card")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Employment Authorization Card")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Mexican Consular Card (Matricula Consular - 2006, 2014, 2015 and later versions)")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Parolee Identification card issued by California Division of Adult Parole Operations, if the card is within six (6) months of the date displayed under the individual's picture")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("United States-issued Visa")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("California Identification cards, issued by the California Department of Motor Vehicles (DMV)")}</li>\n    </ul>`;this.app.notify.showAlertModal("Acceptable ID Documents",t)}POE(){let t=`<div class="fw-bold">${this.app.translate.instant("Program Documents:")}</div>\n    <ul>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Identification card or number from a qualifying assistance program,")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Statement of benefits from Supplemental Security Income (SSI) and/or a qualifying assistance program,")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Notice of eligibility or decision letter of participation from a qualifying assistance program, and/or")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Other official documents.")}</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class="fw-bold mt-2">${this.app.translate.instant("Income Documents:")}</div>\n    <ul>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Front page only of prior year's state (540, 540A, 540 2EZ, 540NR, or 540X), federal (1040, 1040A, 1040EZ, 1040NR, 1040NR-EZ, 1040SS, or 1040X), or tribal tax return,")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Income statements or paycheck stubs for 3 consecutive months with the previous 12 months,")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Statement of benefits from Social Security, Veterans Administration, retirement/pension, Unemployment Compensation, Workers' Compensation, and/or a qualifying assistance program,")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Alimony and/or child support documents, and/or")}</li>\n      <li>${this.app.translate.instant("Other official documents.")}</li>\n    </ul>`;this.app.notify.showAlertModal("Acceptable Income/Program Documents",t)}static{this.\u0275fac=function(i){return new(i||e)(ge(Ti))}}static{this.\u0275cmp=vt({type:e,selectors:[["blade-apply-reqs"]],standalone:!1,decls:29,vars:0,consts:[[1,"bg-custom-blue","text-white"],[1,"container"],[1,"row"],[1,"col-md-8","pt-4"],["translate","",1,"h3"],[1,"row","mt-2"],[1,"col-md-6","text-center","py-3"],[1,"far","fa-fw","fa-3x","fa-address-card","text-custom-orange"],[1,"mt-2"],["translate","",1,"h4"],["translate",""],["translate","",3,"click"],[1,"far","fa-fw","fa-3x","fa-file-lines","text-custom-orange"],[1,"col-md-4","text-center"],["src","../assets/img/2k25/father-son-selfie.webp","width","600","height","445","alt","Father and son taking selfie",1,"mw-100",2,"object-fit","contain","object-position","bottom","width","100%","height","100%"]],template:function(i,o){1&i&&(c(0,"section",0)(1,"div",1)(2,"div",2)(3,"div",3)(4,"h2",4),u(5,"What will I need to apply?"),l(),c(6,"div",5)(7,"div",6)(8,"div"),S(9,"span",7),l(),c(10,"div",8)(11,"h3