t use of the data shall be limited to and consistent with the fulfillment of those purposes previously specified. "),S(11,"br")(12,"br"),u(13," (c)Personal data may not be disclosed, made available, or otherwise used for a purpose other than those specified, except with the consent of the subject of the data, or as required by law or regulation. "),S(14,"br")(15,"br"),u(16," (d)Personal data collected shall be relevant to the purpose for which it is needed. "),S(17,"br")(18,"br"),u(19," (e)The general means by which personal data is protected against loss, unauthorized access, use, modification, or disclosure shall be posted, unless the disclosure of those general means would compromise legitimate agency objectives or law enforcement purposes. "),S(20,"br")(21,"br"),u(22," Each department shall implement this privacy policy by: "),c(23,"ul")(24,"li"),u(25,"Designating which position within the department or agency is responsible for the implementation of and adherence to this privacy policy;"),l(),c(26,"li"),u(27,"Prominently posting the policy physically in its offices and on its internet website, if any;"),l(),c(28,"li"),u(29,"Distributing the policy to each of its employees and contractors who have access to personal data;"),l(),c(30,"li"),u(31,"Complying with the Information Practices Act (Civil Code Section 1798 et seq.); the Public Records Act (Government Code Section 6250 et seq.); Government Code Section 11015.5, and all other laws pertaining to information privacy;"),l(),c(32,"li"),u(33,"Using appropriate means to successfully implement and adhere to this privacy policy."),l()()())}function Yct(e,n){1&e&&(c(0,"div")(1,"h1"),u(2,"Pol\xedtica de privacidad"),l(),S(3,"hr"),u(4," Seg\xfan lo estipulado por el art\xedculo 11019.9 del C\xf3digo Gubernamental, todos los departamentos y organismos del Estado de California deben promulgar y mantener una pol\xedtica permanente de privacidad, junto con la Ley de Pr\xe1cticas de Informaci\xf3n de 1977 (art\xedculo 1798 y siguientes del C\xf3digo Civil), que incluye, entre otros, los siguientes principios:: "),S(5,"br")(6,"br"),u(7," (a)La informaci\xf3n de identificaci\xf3n personal s\xf3lo puede obtenerse a trav\xe9s de medios legales.. "),S(8,"br")(9,"br"),u(10," (b) Los prop\xf3sitos por los cuales se recolecta informaci\xf3n de identificaci\xf3n personal deben especificarse antes o durante el momento de la recolecci\xf3n, y todo uso subsiguiente de la informaci\xf3n se limitar\xe1 al cumplimiento de los prop\xf3sitos especificados anteriormente y ser\xe1 coherente con ellos. "),S(11,"br")(12,"br"),u(13," (c) La informaci\xf3n personal no debe divulgarse, mantenerse disponible ni utilizarse de otro modo para un prop\xf3sito diferente de aqu\xe9llos especificados, a menos que exista un consentimiento del asunto de la informaci\xf3n o en caso de que una ley o norma lo disponga. "),S(14,"br")(15,"br"),u(16," (d) La informaci\xf3n personal recolectada ser\xe1 relevante a los prop\xf3sitos por los cuales es necesaria. "),S(17,"br")(18,"br"),u(19," (e) Los medios generales por los cuales se protege la informaci\xf3n personal contra p\xe9rdida, acceso no autorizado, uso, modificaci\xf3n o divulgaci\xf3n deben publicarse, a menos que la divulgaci\xf3n de estos medios generales comprometa los objetivos leg\xedtimos del organismo o los prop\xf3sitos del cumplimiento de la ley. "),S(20,"br")(21,"br"),u(22," Cada departamento debe implementar esta pol\xedtica de privacidad mediante: "),c(23,"ul")(24,"li"),u(25,"la designaci\xf3n de la posici\xf3n dentro del departamento u organismo que ser\xe1 responsable de la implementaci\xf3n y el cumplimiento de esta pol\xedtica de privacidad;"),l(),c(26,"li"),u(27,"la publicaci\xf3n notable y f\xedsica de la pol\xedtica de privacidad en las oficinas y en los sitios web, si los hubiere;"),l(),c(28,"li"),u(29,"la distribuci\xf3n de la pol\xedtica a cada uno de sus empleados y contratistas que tengan acceso a la informaci\xf3n personal;"),l(),c(30,"li"),u(31,"el cumplimiento de la Ley de Pr\xe1cticas de Informaci\xf3n (art\xedculo 1798 y siguientes del C\xf3digo Civil), la Ley de Registros P\xfablicos (art\xedculo 6250 y siguientes del C\xf3digo Gubernamental), el art\xedculo 11015.5 del C\xf3digo Gubernamental y todas las leyes pertinentes a la privacidad de la informaci\xf3n; y"),l(),c(32,"li"),u(33,"el uso apropiado de los medios para implementar e incorporar de forma exitosa esta pol\xedtica de privacidad."),l()()())}function Uct(e,n){1&e&&(c(0,"div")(1,"h1"),u(2,"\u96b1\u79c1\u6b0a\u653f\u7b56"),l(),S(3,"hr"),u(4," \u6839\u64da\u653f\u5e9c\u6cd5\u898f\u7b2c 11019.9 \u6b3e\u898f\u5b9a\uff0c\u52a0\u5dde\u653f\u5e9c\u6240\u6709\u90e8\u9580\u8207\u6a5f\u69cb\u5747\u61c9\u4f9d 1977 \u5e74\u8cc7\u8a0a\u8655\u7406\u6cd5\u6848 (\u6c11\u6cd5\u7b2c 1798 \u6b3e\u7b49) \u9812\u4f48\u4e26\u9075\u5b88\u6c38\u4e45\u7684\u96b1\u79c1\u6b0a\u653f\u7b56\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\uff08\u4f46\u4e0d\u9650\u65bc\uff09\u4e0b\u5217\u539f\u5247\uff1a "),S(5,"br")(6,"br"),u(7," (a) \u500b\u4eba\u8b58\u5225\u8cc7\u6599\u50c5\u80fd\u7d93\u7531\u5408\u6cd5\u7ba1\u9053\u53d6\u5f97\u3002 "),S(8,"br")(9,"br"),u(10," (b) \u6536\u96c6\u500b\u4eba\u8b58\u5225\u8cc7\u6599\u4e4b\u76ee\u7684\u61c9\u65bc\u6536\u96c6\u7576\u6642\u6216\u4e4b\u524d\u5177\u9ad4\u8aaa\u660e\uff0c\u8a72\u8cc7\u6599\u4e4b\u5f8c\u7e8c\u7528\u9014\u61c9\u9650\u65bc\u4e26\u7b26\u5408\u7576\u521d\u8aaa\u660e\u4e4b\u76ee\u7684\u3002 "),S(11,"br")(12,"br"),u(13," (c) \u9664\u975e\u7d93\u8cc7\u6599\u7576\u4e8b\u4eba\u540c\u610f\uff0c\u6216\u4f9d\u6cd5\u5f8b\u6216\u898f\u5b9a\u8981\u6c42\uff0c\u5426\u5247\u4e0d\u5f97\u62ab\u9732\u3001\u516c\u958b\u63d0\u4f9b\u6216\u5c07\u500b\u4eba\u8cc7\u6599\u7528\u65bc\u975e\u6307\u5b9a\u4e4b\u76ee\u7684\u3002 "),S(14,"br")(15,"br"),u(16," (d) \u6536\u96c6\u7684\u500b\u4eba\u8cc7\u6599\u61c9\u8207\u6536\u96c6\u6240\u9700\u76ee\u7684\u76f8\u95dc\u3002 "),S(17,"br")(18,"br"),u(19," (e) \u61c9\u516c\u4f48\u4fdd\u8b77\u500b\u4eba\u8cc7\u6599\u4ee5\u9632\u