ng b\xe1o r\u1eb1ng California LifeLine c\xf3 \u0111\u1ee7 th\xf4ng tin \u0111\u1ec3 gia h\u1ea1n quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i LifeLine c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, qu\xe1 tr\xecnh gia h\u1ea1n h\xe0ng n\u0103m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\xe3 ho\xe0n t\u1ea5t. v\xe0 b\u1ea1n kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n th\xeam h\xe0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng n\xe0o n\u1eefa. "),c(7,"h4",51),u(8,"Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\xean Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\xecnh LifeLine California l\u1ea5y th\xf4ng tin nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\xe0o \u0111\u1ec3 ho\xe0n th\xe0nh qu\xe1 tr\xecnh gia h\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a t\xf4i?"),l(),u(9," 105 ng\xe0y tr\u01b0\u1edbc ng\xe0y k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m California LifeLine c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd, California Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\xean Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\xecnh LifeLine ki\u1ec3m tra c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n. Khi m\xe0 th\xf4ng tin c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd kh\u1edbp trong c\u01a1 s\u1edf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u1ec1 t\xednh \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n, v\xe0 Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\xecnh Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\xean kh\xf4ng y\xeau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 th\xf4ng tin b\u1ed5 sung n\xe0o t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd \u0111\u1ec3 gia h\u1ea1n l\u1ee3i \xedch LifeLine c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd, th\xec Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\xean Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\xecnh s\u1ebd g\u1eedi m\u1ed9t tin nh\u1eafn v\u0103n b\u1ea3n ho\u1eb7c g\u1eedi m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd \u0111\u1ec3 th\xf4ng b\xe1o cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd bi\u1ebft r\u1eb1ng Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\xecnh Qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb vi\xean c\xf3 \u0111\u1ee7 th\xf4ng tin \u0111\u1ec3 ho\xe0n th\xe0nh vi\u1ec7c gia h\u1ea1n quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i h\xe0ng n\u0103m c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd. "),S(10,"br")(11,"br"),u(12," Khi qu\xe1 tr\xecnh gia h\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\xe0n t\u1ea5t theo c\xe1ch n\xe0y, ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd s\u1ebd kh\xf4ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu gia h\u1ea1n qua th\u01b0 v\xec qu\xe1 tr\xecnh gia h\u1ea1n h\xe0ng n\u0103m \u0111\xe3 ho\xe0n t\u1ea5t. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\xf4ng b\xe1o ch\xednh th\u1ee9c qua \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng b\u01b0u \u0111i\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh gia h\u1ea1n LifeLine v\xe0o ng\xe0y k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng k\xfd. "),S(13,"br")(14,"br"),u(15," N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\xeam c\xe2u h\u1ecfi, b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 g\u1ecdi cho ch\xfang t\xf4i theo s\u1ed1 "),c(16,"strong"),u(17,"877-858-7463"),l(),u(18," ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 tr\xf2 chuy\u1ec7n v\u1edbi ch\xfang t\xf4i b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch nh\u1ea5p v\xe0o "),c(19,"a",52),u(20,"https://www.californialifeline.com/vi/contact"),l(),u(21," v\xe0 sau \u0111\xf3 b\u1ea5m v\xe0o n\xfat TR\xd2 CHUY\u1ec6N. Gi\u1edd l\xe0m vi\u1ec7c c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i l\xe0 t\u1eeb Th\u1ee9 Hai \u0111\u1ebfn Th\u1ee9 S\xe1u, 7 gi\u1edd s\xe1ng \u0111\u1ebfn 7 gi\u1edd t\u1ed1i theo Gi\u1edd Th\xe1i B\xecnh D\u01b0\u01a1ng. "),c(22,"h4",51),u(23,"L\u01b0u \xfd"),l(),u(24," \u0110i\u1ec1u quan tr\u1ecdng l\xe0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tham gia California LifeLine ph\u1ea3i gi\u1eef d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\xe0 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 h\u1ed9p th\u01b0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1edbi c\xe1c nh\xe0 cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 California LifeLine c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd, \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 th\u01b0 t\u1eeb California LifeLine. "),S(25,"br")(26,"br"),l())}function tCt(e,n){1&e&&(c(0,"div")(1,"h3",50),u(2,"Importanteng impormasyon para sa mga subskrayber sa California LifeLine na nakatanggap ng mengsaheng text o awtomatikong tawag mula sa California LifeLine sa nagsabing walang aksyon ay kailangan upang makumpleto ang taunang proseso sa pag-renew sa benepisyo ng Lifeline."),l(),u(3," Ang mga subskrayber sa California LifeLine ay dapat i-renew ang kanilang benepisyo sa Lifeline. "),S(4,"br")(5,"br"),u(6," Kung natanggap mo ang mensahe sa text o ang awtimatikong tawag sa telepono na ipinapaalam sa iyo na mayroong sapat na impormasyon ang California LifeLine upang i-proseso ang pag-renew ng iyong benepisyo ng Lifeline, ang taunang proseso ng pag-renew ay kumpleto na. Hindi na kailangan ang karagdagang aksyon. "),c(7,"h4",51),u(8,"Paano nakuha ng California LifeLine Program Administrator ang impormasyon upang i-kumpleto ang proseso sa pag-renew?"),l(),u(9," 105 araw bago sa petsa ng anibersaryo ng California LifeLine subskrayber, sinusuri ng California LifeLine Program Administrator ang handang databases ng pagiging karapat-dapat. Kapag tumugma ang impormasyon ng subskrayber sa eligibility database, at hindi na kailangan ng Program Administrator ang karagdagang impormasyon mula sa subskrayber upang i-renew ang benipisyo ng LifeLine subskrayber, ang Program Administrator ay magpapadala ng mensahe sa text o maggawa ang awtimatikong tawag sa subskrayber upang ipalaam sa subskrayber na mayroon na sapat ng impormasyon ang Program Administrator upang i-kumpleto and taunang renewal sa benipisyo ng California LifeLine subskrayber. "),S(10,"br")(11,"br"),u(12," Kapag nakumpleto ng ganito ang proseso ng pag-renew ng subskrayber, hindi matatanggap ng subskrayber ang form ng pag-renew sa koreo dahil ang taunang proseso ng renewal ay kumpleto na. Ipapadala ng Lifeline sa subskrayber ang opisyal na abiso ng desisyong sa pag-renew sa petsa ng anibersaryo ng subskrayber. "),S(13,"br")(14,"br"),u(15," Kung maroon kang karagdagang tanong, mangyaring tawagan kami sa "),c(16,"strong"),u(17,"877-858-7463"),l(),u(18," o mag-click upang mag chat sa amin sa "),c(19,"a",52),u(20,"https://www.californialifelin.com/tl/contact"),l(),u(21," at pagkatapos mag-click sa pindutang CHAT. Ang aming oras ng opersyon ay lunes hanggang biyernes, a las 7 sa umaga hanggang a las 7 sa hapon Pacific Time. "),c(22,"h4",51),u(23,"Mga Pangkalahatang tala at tip"),l(),u(24," Mahalagang panatiling na-update ang serbisyo at mailing address ng mga kalahok sa kanilang service providers, upang matanggap nila ang lahat na mga sulat mula sa California LifeLine. "),S(25,"br")(26,"br"),l())}function nCt(e,n){1&e&&(c(0,"div"),u(1," The California LifeLine Program checks the personal identification (PI) information that applicants and participants submit to the California LifeLine Administrator to find out if the submitted PI information matches a person's identity. Individuals can be punished for giving false information on their application or renewal forms to get the discounts. "),S(2,"br")(3,"br"),u(4," When the California LifeLine Administrator is unable to authenticate the submitted PI information, the California LifeLine Program requires the applicant or participant to submit additional documentation such as the ID Authentication Form and a copy of one or more of the acceptable types of identification documents. "),S(5,"br")(6,"br"),u(7," The consumer must submit to the California LifeLine Administrator both the completed and signed ID Authentication Form and the COPY of identification documentation by the due date indicated on the form. "),S(8,"br")(9,"br"),u(10," The identification document must include a photo, match at least two personal information factors (e.g., name, home address, date of birth, and last four of the social security number), which are already provided by the consumer to the California LifeLine Administrator, be current, be legible, and be one of the types of identification documents listed below. "),S(11,"br")(12,"br"),u(13," The acceptable types of identification documents are: "),c(14,"ul")(15,"li"),u(16,"U.S. Driver License"),l(),c(17,"li"),u(18,"Certificate of U.S. Citizenship"),l(),c(19,"li"),u(20,"Certificate of Naturalization or Citizenship"),l(),c(21,"li"),u(22,"U.S. Passport/U.S. Territory Passport"),l(),c(23,"li"),u(24,"Foreign Passport"),l(),c(25,"li"),u(26,"U.S. government, military, state or Tribal issued-ID, which includes date of birth and/or Social Security Number and/or Tribal ID"),l(),c(27,"li"),u(28,"U.S. Military ID cards (active or reserve duty, dependent of a military member, retired member, discharged from service, medical/religious personnel)"),l(),c(29,"li"),u(30,"Common Access Card (only if designated as Active Military or Active Reserve or Active Selected Reserve)"),l(),c(31,"li"),u(32,"Military Discharge documentation, which includes date of birth and/or Social Security Number and/or Tribal ID"),l(),c(33,"li"),u(34,"Northern Mariana Card"),l(),c(35,"li"),u(36,"Permanent Resident Card"),l(),c(37,"li"),u(38,"Permanent Resident Alien Card"),l(),c(39,"li"),u(40,"Permanent Resident Re-Entry Permit"),l(),c(41,"li"),u(42,"Temporary Resident Identification Card"),l(),c(43,"li"),u(44,"Employment Authorization Card"),l(),c(45,"li"),u(46,"Mexican Consular Card (Matricula Consular - 2006, 2014, 2015 and later versions)"),l(),c(47,"li"),u(48,"Parolee Identification card issued by California Division of Adult Parole Operations, if the card is within six (6) months of the date displayed under the individual's picture"),l(),c(49,"li"),u(50,"United States-issued Visa"),l(),c(51,"li"),u(52,"California Identification cards, issued by the California Department of Motor Vehicles (DMV)"),l()(),u(53," The ID Check may require consumers to submit an ID Authentication Form with a color photograph of one or more acceptable identification documents to authenticate a consumer's identity. A black and white photocopy is only accepted through USPS mail, not electronically. "),S(54,"br")(55,"br"),u(56," The California LifeLine Administrator must be able to properly authenticate an applicant's or participant's identity. If the applicant or participant fails the ID Check, then the California LifeLine Administrator will NOT approve enrollment into the California LifeLine Program. "),S(57,"br")(58,"br"),u(59," Please note that only those acceptable types of IDs issued by an official government agency would be permitted by the California LifeLine Administrator (except military ID and Tribal-issued ID). "),S(60,"br")(61,"br"),u(62," The following types of identification documents that are issued by any government agency or entity are NOT ACCEPTABLE: "),c(63,"ul")(64,"li"),u(65,"Prison IDs"),l(),c(66,"li"),u(67,"Employee IDs"),l(),c(68,"li"),u(69,"School IDs"),l()(),u(70," The California LifeLine Administrator denies participation into the program if the consumer fails to pass the ID Check. A consumer may fail the ID Check for the following reasons: "),c(71,"ol")(72,"li"),u(73,"inability to prove the consumer's identity using the information already provided to the California LifeLine Administrator;"),l(),c(74,"li"),u(75,"the identification document does not match the consumer;"),l(),c(76,"li"),u(77,"the identification document provided by the consumer is not listed under the acceptable types of identification documents; and"),l(),c(78,"li"),u(79,"the California LifeLine Administrator does not have evidence that the ID Authentication Form and the identification document were submitted."),l()(),u(80," The California LifeLine Administrator will mail its eligibility decision to the applicant or participant. "),S(81,"br")(82,"br"),c(83,"h3",53),u(84,"ONLY ONE CALIFORNIA LIFELINE DISCOUNTED SERVICE PER HOUSEHOLD IS ALLOWED"),l(),u(85," It is important to remember that only one California LifeLine discounted phone service per household is allowed. The California LifeLine discounts can only be for the individual's primary residence. An individual can only have one primary residence. "),S(86,"br")(87,"br"),u(88," Each household must choose to get the discount either on a home phone or on a cell phone, but not on both. Households cannot get the discount from multiple phone companies. Households that do not follow the one discounted service per household rule will lose their discounts, and may be prosecuted by the U.S. government. Receiving multiple discounted phone services violates the program's rules. "),S(89,"br")(90,"br"),u(91," Penalties for violating the California LifeLine Program's rules can include imprisonment, losing the discounts, monetary fines, and being banned from the California LifeLine Program. The California LifeLine Program can also seek repayment of the discounts that should not have been received from the program. "),S(92,"br")(93,"br"),l())}function iCt(e,n){1&e&&(c(0,"div"),u(1," El programa de California LifeLine debe comprobar la informaci\xf3n de identificaci\xf3n personal (PI) que los solicitantes y los participantes someten al administrador de California LifeLine para averiguar si la informaci\xf3n de identidad personal presentada coincide con la identidad de esa persona. Los individuos pueden ser castigados por dar informaci\xf3n falsa en su solicitud o renovaci\xf3n con el fin de obtener los descuentos. "),S(2,"br")(3,"br"),u(4," Cuando el administrador de California LifeLine no puede autenticar la informaci\xf3n de identificaci\xf3n personal sometida, el programa de California LifeLine requiere que el solicitante o participante presente documentaci\xf3n adicional, como la autenticaci\xf3n de formulario de identificaci\xf3n y una copia de uno o m\xe1s tipos de documentos de identificaci\xf3n aceptables. "),S(5,"br")(6,"br"),u(7," El consumidor debe someter una copia del formulario de autenticaci\xf3n de identidad firmada al igual que un documento de identificaci\xf3n antes de la fecha de vencimiento indiciada en el formulario. "),S(8,"br")(9,"br"),u(10," El documento de identificaci\xf3n debe incluir una foto , partido de al menos dos factores de informaci\xf3n personal (por ejemplo , nombre, direcci\xf3n de servicio , fecha de nacimiento, y \xfaltimos cuatro digitos del n\xfamero de seguro social ), que ya son provistos por el consumidor al administrador de California LifeLine , estar al d\xeda , ser legibles, y ser uno de los tipos de documentos de identificaci\xf3n en la lista siguiente. "),S(11,"br")(12,"br"),u(13," Los documentos que son aceptables son los siguientes: "),c(14,"ul")(15,"li"),u(16,"Licencia de Conducir de EE.UU"),l(),c(17,"li"),u(18,"Certificado de Ciudadan\xeda de EE.UU"),l(),c(19,"li"),u(20,"Certificado de Naturalizaci\xf3n o Ciudadan\xeda"),l(),c(21,"li"),u(22,"Pasaporte de EE.UU / Pasaporte de Territorio de EE.UU"),l(),c(23,"li"),u(24,"Pasaporte Extranjero"),l(),c(25,"li"),u(26,"Gobierno de Estados Unidos , militar , estatal o ID- emitida tribal , que incluye la fecha de nacimiento y / o n\xfamero de Seguro Social y / o tribal ID"),l(),c(27,"li"),u(28,"Identificaci\xf3n de la militar estadounidense (en servicio activo o reserva, dependiente de un miembro militar, miembro retirado, dados de baja en el servicio, el personal m\xe9dico / religioso)"),l(),c(29,"li"),u(30,"Tarjeta de acceso com\xfan (s\xf3lo si designada como Militar Activo, Activo en Reserva o Activo en Reserva de Selecci\xf3n)"),l(),c(31,"li"),u(32,"Documentaci\xf3n de descarga Militar, que incluye la fecha de nacimiento y / o n\xfamero de Seguro Social y / o n\xfamero de identificaci\xf3n de tierras tribales."),l(),c(33,"li"),u(34,"Tarjeta de las Islas Marianas del Norte"),l(),c(35,"li"),u(36,"Tarjeta de Residente Permanente"),l(),c(37,"li"),u(38,"Tarjeta de Residente Permanente Extranjero"),l(),c(39,"li"),u(40,"Permiso de Reingreso de Residente Permanente"),l(),c(41,"li"),u(42,"arjeta de Identificaci\xf3n de Residente Temporal"),l(),c(43,"li"),u(44,"Tarjeta de Permiso de Trabajo"),l(),c(45,"li"),u(46,"Tarjeta Consular mexicana ( Matr\xedcula Consular - 2006 , 2014, 2015 y versiones posteriores )"),l(),c(47,"li"),u(48,"Tarjeta de identificaci\xf3n de libertad condicional emitida por la Divisi\xf3n de Operaciones de Libertad Condicional para Adultos de California, si la tarjeta est\xe1 dentro de seis (6) meses de la fecha debajo de la imagen"),l(),c(49,"li"),u(50,"Visa emitida en los Estados Unidos"),l(),c(51,"li"),u(52,"Tarjetas de identificaci\xf3n de California, emitidas por el Departamento de Veh\xedculos Motorizados de California (DMV)"),l()(),u(53," La Verificaci\xf3n de identificaci\xf3n puede requerir que los consumidores env\xeden un Formulario de autenticaci\xf3n de identificaci\xf3n con una fotograf\xeda en color de uno o m\xe1s documentos de identificaci\xf3n aceptables para autenticar la identidad de un consumidor. Solo se acepta una fotocopia en blanco y negro a trav\xe9s del correo de USPS, no electr\xf3nicamente. "),S(54,"br")(55,"br"),u(56," El administrador de California LifeLine debe tener la oportunidad de autenticar correctamente la identidad del solicitante o participante. Si el solicitante o participante falla la autenticaci\xf3n de identidad, el administrador de California LifeLine NO podr\xe1 aprobar la petici\xf3n de inscripci\xf3n para el programa de California LifeLine. "),S(57,"br")(58,"br"),u(59," Tenga en cuenta que s\xf3lo los tipos aceptables de IDs emitidas por una agencia oficial del gobierno se les permitir\xeda por el administrador de California LifeLine (excepto identificaci\xf3n militar y emitida tribal ID). "),S(60,"br")(61,"br"),u(62," Los siguientes tipos de documentos de identificaci\xf3n emitidos por cualquier agencia o entidad gubernamental NO SON ACEPTABLES: "),c(63,"ul")(64,"li"),u(65,"ID de prisi\xf3n"),l(),c(66,"li"),u(67,"ID de los empleados"),l(),c(68,"li"),u(69,"ID de la escuela"),l()(),u(70," El administrador de California LifeLine niega la participaci\xf3n en el programa si el consumidor no logra pasar el chequeo de Identificaci\xf3n. Un consumidor puede fallar el chequeo de Identificaci\xf3n por las siguientes razones : "),c(71,"ol")(72,"li"),u(73,"incapacidad para demostrar la identidad del consumidor, utilizando la informaci\xf3n ya facilitada al administrador de California LifeLine;"),l(),c(74,"li"),u(75,"el documento de identificaci\xf3n no coincide con el consumidor;"),l(),c(76,"li"),u(77,"el documento de identificaci\xf3n proporcionada por el consumidor no aparece en los tipos aceptables de documentos de identificaci\xf3n ; y"),l(),c(78,"li"),u(79,"el administrador de California LifeLine no tiene pruebas de que presentaron el Formulario de autenticaci\xf3n de identidad y el documento de identificaci\xf3n."),l()(),u(80," El administrador de California LifeLine le enviara su decisi\xf3n de elegibilidad para el solicitante o participante por correo. "),S(81,"br")(82,"br"),c(83,"h3",53),u(84,"S\xf3lo se permite un descuento de California LifeLine por hogar."),l(),u(85," Es importante recordar que solo se permite un descuento de California LifeLine por hogar. Los descuentos de California LifeLine solo pueden ser para el hogar principal de la persona solicitando el descuento. Una persona solo puede tener un hogar principal. "),S(86,"br")(87,"br"),u(88," Cada hogar debe elegir si gusta recibir el descuento en su tel\xe9fono de casa o en un tel\xe9fono celular, pero no en ambos. Las familias no pueden obtener el descuento de varias compa\xf1\xedas telef\xf3nicas. Los hogares que no siguen el reglamento indicado para el descuento de California LifeLine perder\xe1n sus descuentos y pueden ser procesados pero el gobierno de Estados Unidos. Recibir m\xe1s de un descuento en m\xe1s de un tipo de servicio telef\xf3nico viola las reglas del programa. "),S(89,"br")(90,"br"),u(91," Las sanciones por violar las reglas del programa de California LifeLine pueden incluir encarcelamiento, perdida de los descuentos, multas monetarias, y ser expulsado del programa de California LifeLine. El programa de California LifeLine tambi\xe9n puede solicitar la devoluci\xf3n de los descuentos que no deber\xeda haber recibido. "),S(92,"br")(93,"br"),l())}function oCt(e,n){1&e&&(c(0,"div"),u(1," \u52a0\u5dde\u666e\u6fdf\u8a08\u5283\u8981\u6aa2\u67e5\u7533\u8acb\u4eba\u548c\u53c3\u8207\u8005\u63d0\u4ea4\u7d66\u52a0\u5dde\u666e\u6fdf\u7ba1\u7